{"page":7,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:38","surah":2,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْنَا ٱهْبِطُوا۟ مِنْهَا جَمِيعًا ۖ فَإِمَّا يَأْتِيَنَّكُم مِّنِّى هُدًى فَمَن تَبِعَ هُدَاىَ فَلَا خَوْفٌ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا هُمْ يَحْزَنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We said, ‘Get out, all of you! But when guidance comes from Me, as it certainly will, there will be no fear for those who follow My guidance nor will they grieve-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْنَا","en_gloss":"We said","transliteration":"qul'nā","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱهْبِطُوا۟","en_gloss":"Go down","transliteration":"ih'biṭū","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنْهَا","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"جَمِيعًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"all (of you)","transliteration":"jamīʿan","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَإِمَّا","en_gloss":"and when","transliteration":"fa-immā","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَأْتِيَنَّكُم","en_gloss":"comes to you","transliteration":"yatiyannakum","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنِّى","en_gloss":"from Me","transliteration":"minnī","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هُدًۭى","en_gloss":"Guidance","transliteration":"hudan","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَمَن","en_gloss":"then whoever","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَبِعَ","en_gloss":"follows","transliteration":"tabiʿa","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":11,"ar":"هُدَاىَ","en_gloss":"My Guidance","transliteration":"hudāya","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"[then] no","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":13,"ar":"خَوْفٌ","en_gloss":"fear","transliteration":"khawfun","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"(will be) on them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":16,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يَحْزَنُونَ","en_gloss":"will grieve","transliteration":"yaḥzanūna","verse_key":"2:38"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٣٨","en_gloss":"(38)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:38"}]},{"verse_key":"2:39","surah":2,"ayah":39,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَكَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلنَّارِ ۖ هُمْ فِيهَا خَـٰلِدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"those who disbelieve and deny Our messages shall be the inhabitants of the Fire, and there they will remain.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"2:39"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"who disbelieve[d]","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"2:39"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَكَذَّبُوا۟","en_gloss":"and deny","transliteration":"wakadhabū","verse_key":"2:39"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ","en_gloss":"Our Signs","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"2:39"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"2:39"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","en_gloss":"(are the) companions","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","verse_key":"2:39"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāri","verse_key":"2:39"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"2:39"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"2:39"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَـٰلِدُونَ","en_gloss":"(will) abide forever","transliteration":"khālidūna","verse_key":"2:39"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٣٩","en_gloss":"(39)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:39"}]},{"verse_key":"2:40","surah":2,"ayah":40,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰبَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ ٱذْكُرُوا۟ نِعْمَتِىَ ٱلَّتِىٓ أَنْعَمْتُ عَلَيْكُمْ وَأَوْفُوا۟ بِعَهْدِىٓ أُوفِ بِعَهْدِكُمْ وَإِيَّـٰىَ فَٱرْهَبُونِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Children of Israel, remember how I blessed you. Honour your pledge to Me and I will honour My pledge to you: I am the One you should fear.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰبَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"O Children","transliteration":"yābanī","verse_key":"2:40"},{"po